Root cause:
The bug was caused by a regression introduced in commit 9a518d8, which resulted in not properly closing a file descriptor and incorrectly handling container devices. The logic for determining if a device is a container was flawed, as it did not check the "level" sysfs entry, leading to the array state always being marked as "inactive" for containers. This oversight caused the system to not alert when a device disappeared, as it failed to differentiate between regular devices and container devices.
